<title>POLAND: Poland cuts May T-bill offer to PLN 5.2 bln.</title>
<headline>Poland cuts May T-bill offer to PLN 5.2 bln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poland cut its May T-bill offer to 5.2 billion zlotys from 5.7 billion zlotys in April, the finance ministry said on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
